 "fleshExperimentLines": [
  "Rosa sets aside time with Cliffhanger flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Rosa tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Rosa sets aside time with Hushpuppy flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Rosa tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Rosa sets aside time with Ugly-Eyes flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Rosa tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it."
 ],
