 "plentyVoiceSamples": [
  "d2: 🍽️ Rosa checks the pantry before heading out, then hangs back. \"Shelves are full to bursting. Patching the boots today.\"",
  "d2: 🍽️ Vasyl watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\"",
  "d3: 🍽️ Vasyl takes one look at the full shelves and unshoulders the pack. \"Leave the wild standing. Hauling water for the cistern.\"",
  "d3: 🍽️ Ming sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\"",
  "d4: 🍽️ Vasyl surveys the stacked shelves and nods. \"The wild can rest. Splitting firewood instead — winter comes whether we like it or not.\"",
  "d4: 🍽️ Hassan carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"",
  "d5: 🍽️ Vasyl checks the pantry before heading out, then hangs back. \"Shelves are full to bursting. Patching the boots today.\"",
  "d5: 🍽️ Aroha looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"",
  "d6: 🍽️ Vasyl peeks into the pantry, then turns the foraging party back. \"Plenty for days. Teaching the kids snares instead — they'll need to know.\"",
  "d6: 🍽️ Somchai watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\"",
  "d7: 🍽️ Vasyl weighs the day's basket against the pantry shelves and puts it down. \"Enough. Carving bowls instead — we're down to the cracked ones.\"",
  "d7: 🍽️ Vasyl leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"",
  "d9: 🍽️ Vasyl taps the pantry's fullest jar. \"More than we can eat before it turns. Rendering fat instead — the lamps won't fill themselves.\"",
  "d9: 🍽️ Somchai carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"",
